> Hold final weights and targets fixed while blanking only the condition

The source-only generator prediction and its zero-source counterfactual differ
by at most.324878186. D's real-target patch logits change by at most1.047154665
when that same condition is blanked. These controls prove that both maps depend
on the source; they do not establish accurate paired reconstruction. All200-row
blank conditions,predictions and real-target logits are preserved. Inference and
these controls leave both restored stores unchanged, and single/batch generation
agrees exactly.

