The independent NumPy checker verifies all1097600 binary condition pixels,
205155 captured parameter derivatives(maximum discrepancy1.22e-6),1577832
forward values(maximum6.01e-6),43 representative final scalar finite differences
and all192 Adam transitions bit exactly. All3000 fitting row visits and every
phase's unselected store are checked. Native delegation and the report reproduce
the full original artifacts and every additional phase/probe archive exactly.

These checks establish the intended computation and schedule. They do not convert
the weak three-epoch result into a good translator. The fixed-final metrics,
original gallery, ten-class preview, blank-condition controls, fitting-only mean
and complete editable C++ program remain together so that the limitation is visible.
